{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-03_beg",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-03",
  "title": "麥稈，極易燃燒",
  "storyCode": "R8-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "531a4d76e4e97dad083ee8aa3034ef739ffdb543762122bbb696f31606d18b49",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "暉潔：\n接著上次那件事說。\n我逃了很久，逃到一個小村子裡。\n我當時沒想那麼多，只是想找個地方藏起來，沒想到我真的找到了一個棲身之所。\n這一對老夫婦，可能是把我當做了他們的女兒。畢竟烏薩斯那麼多場戰爭，他們的子女可能很早就犧牲了。\n就連我的秘密他們也幫忙藏住了。\n我想我怎麼報答他們都不過分。\n遺憾的是，我沒能好好報答他們。\n1月13日"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "上一次的例行檢查中，我們有一個隊員遭到了襲擊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "現在，每一戶都要接受搜查。不僅是感染者，一旦我們發現襲擊者，我們會立刻擊殺他們，而窩藏他們的村戶，也會受到懲罰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "不想服苦役的話，就告發他們。沒人會因為你們光榮的報告受到傷害，而罪犯和感染者將得到他們應有的下場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "接下來，從第一戶開始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "老奶奶，這一天還是來了。我肯定是躲不過的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "別出去，塔露拉！藏在草棚後面......他們不會查的！我們就說你害怕受到懲罰，逃跑了！沒有人會怪你的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "可你們會被傷害的。這不該是我報答你們的方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我留下了一點金幣......這些是維多利亞金幣，你們省著點花，一定夠你們這輩子吃飽穿暖的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "塔露拉，塔露拉！你要去哪？我的塔露拉......不可以，你不可以和他們見面啊！這些糾察隊的黑蟲子吃人不眨眼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "所以不能讓他們再壓榨村子裡的叔叔阿姨了。這種事應該有個結束。我會引開他們，警醒他們，我會讓他們知道後果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我知道分寸的，老奶奶。我可不會讓他們借機報復，再殺害村子裡的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我還記得隔壁的弟弟只是因為扔了個石頭就被活活打死。我忘不掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "塔露拉......塔露拉！別這麼說......別這麼說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "誰！誰在敲門......是糾察隊嗎！走開！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "老媽媽，是我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "阿麗娜！快進來，快進來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "怎麼了？發生什麼事了？有消息嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "......有人告密了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "啊？什麼？什麼告密？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "糾察隊知道我們村子裡有一個感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "怎麼可能，不會這樣的......啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "我不知道他們從哪裡得來的消息，但是我們都明白包藏感染者的下場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "老媽媽，我爸爸去世得早，媽媽也全賴你們照顧，我把你們就當是我自己的爺爺奶奶一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "到現在這個關頭，我也沒什麼好隱瞞的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "——等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "奶奶，爺爺他去了哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "臭老頭子，你是來做什麼的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "我犯了罪！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "自首？啊，對，我記得了。我們那個隊員是被一個老頭攔下了。看你這一瘸一拐的，你就是當時的襲擊者之一吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "對！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "......看你也沒什麼油水可敲。有多遠滾多遠吧。那個小伙子也是不知好歹，跟窮農民吵什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "不止。老爺，你看看我身上這塊，你看像什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "感染者！感染者就是你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你說什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "我當時給你換衣服的時候，都看到啦......塔露拉，你是感染者，我和老頭子知道很久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "那——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "老頭子去礦場賺點錢，也是染了礦石病才回來的！你看他一直穿著他那個夾克不肯脫掉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "老頭子是要替你頂罪啊，塔露拉......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "不行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "這豈不是說爺爺他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "村子裡那些人都信不過的！只要是為了錢，為了保命，他們什麼事都能往外說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "這兩年，塔露拉，我們真的很喜歡你！你是個好孩子......是個好孩子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "我們也沒幾天好活了，但是你，塔露拉，就算得了病，你也是能再多活幾年的！你得好好活著才行......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦",
      "text": "塔露拉，別去！別去啊......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "抓我走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "老爺，抓我走吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "你看我這身上！我才是那個得了病的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "不信的話，你就看看這個吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "刀？把刀放下。老頭，你傷不到我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "不，老爺，你看看我的法術......你看看我的法術！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人切開了自己的手腕，紅色沒有流進雪地，而是像霧一樣彌散在空氣中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "你看，你看......老爺！我是貨真價實的感染者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "我相信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者糾察隊",
      "text": "感謝你的合作，感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "唔......唔......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老漢",
      "text": "塔露拉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "塔露拉！回來！別去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "這是......火？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "這是什麼？！為什麼房子燒起來了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "塔露拉！這是你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "text": "不要去！！塔露拉！！這樣整個村子都會遭殃的！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
